        "original_id": "7b59dbf8-a8b7-55ad-a47c-cacc863457cb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: University of the Philippines, The NorthCap University, Ateneo de Manila University\n- Places: Philippines, Gurugram, Haryana, India\n- People: Nicanor Tiongson\n- Topics: state university systems, autonomous universities, academic degrees\n\nFacts:\n- The University of the Philippines is a state university system in the Philippines.\n- The NorthCap University was formerly named ITM University.\n- The NorthCap University is an autonomous university in Sector 23-A, Gurugram, Haryana, India.\n- Nicanor Tiongson holds a Bachelor of Humanities degree from Ateneo de Manila University.\n- Nicanor Tiongson holds M.A. and Ph.D. degrees in Philippine Studies from the University of the Philippines.",
